  "reason": "Existing evidence shows scvi_n200 (RNA encoder) and multiprofile settings improve RNA-only performance (config_005: 0.6501). This experiment tests combining scvi_n200 with the more powerful imagenet_vit_l image encoder in a multimodal multiprofile setup using avgpool aggregation. It isolates the impact of advanced image encoders while leveraging the best RNA encoder and multiprofile benefits, addressing key uncertainties about modal synergy and encoder choices."
